    "dateLastActivity": "2026-11-12T23:15:56.758Z",
    "desc": "## Lore:\n\n**“Glory Days.”**\n\n**The Stand of Bobby Jean. It is a pure ability Stand that allows Bobby Jean to manipulate the speed of the bullets he fires.**\n\n---\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43526744449749b06bc10/attachments/6ab54b9829e353fe600168bb/previews/6ab54b9929e353fe6001698d/download/image.webp)\n\n## Pose:\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43526744449749b06bc10/attachments/6ae11bd447386be9c2cae1f5/previews/6ae11bd547386be9c2cae2c0/download/image.webp)\n\n---\n\n### Gun Controls\n\n**Use E to draw the gun and M1 to fire. The magazine must be refilled with Reload. Glory changes the behavior of newly fired rounds, while Elevator Trap sets up a seperate crossfire.**\n\n## M1 Light Combo & M2 Attack\n\n![glory.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43526744449749b06bc10/attachments/6ab54f01b3b042ebcc32d210/previews/6ab54f08b3b042ebcc32df43/download/glory.gif)\n\n## Glory\n\n**Toggle Glory to suspend newly fired rounds in midair.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 0.3s**\n\n![glory2.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43526744449749b06bc10/attachments/6ab54f4a96c320fe7a27b965/previews/6ab54f5196c320fe7a27c17b/download/glory2.gif)\n\n## Release:\n\n![release.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43526744449749b06bc10/attachments/6ab54f7a7150e8558f6263d6/previews/6ab54f7c7150e8558f6265ea/download/release.gif)\n\n## Reload\n\n**Reload your gun Stand’s magazine.**\n\n![reload.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43526744449749b06bc10/attachments/6ab54fc00e274e795e9eaa7f/previews/6ab54fc10e274e795e9eabec/download/reload.gif)\n\n## Knock Knock\n\n**Kick forward, striking enemies in front of you.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 28s**\n\n![knockknock.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43526744449749b06bc10/attachments/6ab55020e7bcfb7165e55a77/previews/6ab55023e7bcfb7165e568e2/download/knockknock.gif)\n\n## Elevator Trap\n\n**Set a hidden crossfire with Glory Days. The bullets close in when an enemy enters.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 23s**\n\n![trapbullet.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43526744449749b06bc10/attachments/6ab5509cf6d8c1165bf6fc0c/previews/6ab550a0f6d8c1165bf6fefb/download/trapbullet.gif)",
